# A finger's controls (mbui's press sink, the switch's and the segmented choice's lens): 关于's switch row held and let
# go (the row sinking, the switch's knob a lens of liquid glass while held), then held again; MBUI_FIXTURE=settings-about.
timeout 20000
until 服务条款
wait 800
hold 700 发送使用统计
wait 1200
hold 700 发送使用统计
wait 1200
tap 更新日志
wait 1200
exit
